<title>POLAND: Mostostal-E signs PLN 160 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-E signs PLN 160 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish trading and construction firm Mostostal Export SA signed a 160 million zloty contract to build a sewage treatement plant in the central city of Bydgoszcz, it said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>It said the plant would be competed in 32 months.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
